    new "Dana ile ilk randevunuzda The Pit'e gittikten sonra, her akşam onunla randevuya çıkabileceksiniz."

    # game/Scenes/Dana/DanaDates/danagrottodate.rpy:4
    old "If you have unlocked The Grotto on Whitney's path, you'll be able to take Dana there."
